<title>USA: Lake Cty, Ill., won by Bernardi Securities.</title>
<headline>Lake Cty, Ill., won by Bernardi Securities.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bernardi Securities said it won $1.250 million of Lake Cty, Ill., water and sewer system subordinate revenue bonds, Series 1997 S, with a net interest cost of 5.51 percent.</p>
</text>
